This patch adds comprehensive data persistence improvements to prevent data loss:

1. Add onBlur handlers to current housing/transport cost inputs
2. Add onBlur and onKeyPress (Enter) to custom expense inputs
3. Add onBlur and onKeyPress (Enter) to savings inputs
4. Ensure all edits save immediately when user leaves field or presses Enter

Changes needed in CashflowBudget.js:

Line 444-450 (Current Housing Cost Input):
- Add onBlur handler to explicitly save to localStorage
- Add onKeyPress handler for Enter key

Line 464-470 (Current Transport Cost Input):
- Add onBlur handler to explicitly save to localStorage  
- Add onKeyPress handler for Enter key

Line 487-493 (Custom Expense Input):
- Add onBlur to call handleSaveExpense
- Add onKeyPress for Enter key to call handleSaveExpense

Line 657-663 (Savings Input):
- Add onBlur to call handleSaveSaving
- Add onKeyPress for Enter key to call handleSaveSaving
